        <externalId>false</externalId>
        <inlineHelpText>For multi-segmented Products, this is the type of price dimeension (e.g. &quot;YEAR&quot;, &quot;MONTH&quot;, &quot;QUARTER&quot;) of the order item.</inlineHelpText>
